  "body": "Hey,\r\nin Input Events [1] we refer to multiple drag and drop related definitions. As we try to move to the `[=xref=]` syntax, we notice that several of these are not being exported [2]. So currently we are linking to the following using the `data-cite`-attribute:\r\n\r\n> html/dnd.html#drag-data-store\r\n> html/dnd.html#the-drag-data-item-kind\r\n> html/dnd.html#concept-dnd-ro\r\n> html/dnd.html#the-drag-data-item-type-string\r\n> html/dnd.html#drag-data-store-item-list\r\n> \r\n\r\n[1] https://github.com/w3c/input-events\r\n\r\n[2] https://github.com/w3c/input-events/issues/129",
